rative location address", "State associated with program administrative location address; CNCS uses USPS State abbreviation; Programs may be connected to Service Locations located in other states/territories", "Service Location -\n Location of site where AmeriCorps members or Senior Corps volunteers served; Program/Project Location - Administrative site of CNCS-supported program or project, where services may or may not have been provided", "Abbreviated corporate program codes", "Major service streams consist of corporate programs that further delineate the support provided", "USDA Department of Agriculture Rural-Urban Continuum Codes based on population", "Major streams of service and sources of funds within CNCS", "System assigned unique ID; Blank value due to award made by Intermediaries outside of CNCS' transaction system", "Name of entity receiving award", "Name of the program/project that implements or otherwise oversees services", "System assigned unique ID; National subgrantee grant (except SIF) and operating site IDs are not included in the 2016-2017 State Profiles dataset", "Latitude and longitude using the location type address as source", "USDA Department of Agriculture Rural-Urban Continuum Codes based on population", "5-digit ZIP code associated with program administrative location address; CNCS uses USPS Zip Code; Note: leading zeros (0) may be missing"], "columns_format": [{"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"view": "address_coords", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}, {"displayStyle": "plain", "align": "left"}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2017-05-17T17:15:28.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": ["health"], "tags": [], "domain_category": "Grants and Grantees", "domain_tags": ["grantees", "members", "programs", "projects", "service locations", "volunteers"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Common-Core_Contact-Email", "value": "OpenData@cns.gov"}, {"key": "Common-Core_Program-Code", "value": "485:000"}, {"key": "Common-Core_Publisher", "value": "Corporation for National and Community Service"}, {"key": "Common-Core_Bureau-Code", "value": "485:00"}, {"key": "Common-Core_Contact-Name", "value": "Corporation for National and Community Service"}, {"key": "Scope-and-Iteration_Coverage", "value": "National"}, {"key": "Scope-and-Iteration_Granularity", "value": "Neighborhood"}, {"key": "Scope-and-Iteration_Time-Period", "value": "2/10/2016 - 2/10/2017"}, {"key": "Additional-Information_Limitations", "value": "(1) The locations in this dataset are not \u201creal time,\u201d meaning they are not necessarily active on the date of viewing this dataset. (2) Due to varying performance and reporting periods and requirements, both across and within CNCS programs, some data values may appear as zero or blank in this dataset. (3) Location data is masked so as not to reveal the exact street address of potentially sensitive service sites and programs. The location remains in the general vicinity of the actual location. Some sites may be completely masked due to beneficiary privacy concerns. (4) Services may be provided at some Program/Project Locations as well as Service Locations, either by members and volunteers or by the organization directly. (5) The \u2018AmeriCorps Territory\u2019 code does not include the U.S. Territories Guam or Puerto Rico, which are managed as AmeriCorps State Competitive and AmeriCorps State Formula awards. (6) The \u2018AmeriCorps State Without Commission\u2019 code is for single state direct project relationships between CNCS and the grantee. These can include programs operating in a state without a state commission or some special program types, such as some justice AmeriCorps programs. (7) \u2018AmeriCorps Indian Tribes\u2019 may not include all awards to tribal entities. (8) Locations data found in the dataset that are not rendering on maps may have latitude/longitude or underlying address inaccuracies. (9) All other limitations and notations relevant to the CNCS State Profiles 2016-2017 reports are attributable to this dataset. For more information, see Source Link. (10) CNCS is not responsible for the quality or accuracy of analyses and reports created from this dataset by non-CNCS entities."}, {"key": "Additional-Information_Data-Collection", "value": "This dataset comes from administrative data provided to CNCS by grantee/sponsor organizations."}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "data.americorps.gov", "license": "Public Domain U.S. Government"}, "permalink": "https://data.americorps.gov/d/v35n-m8im", "link": "https://data.americorps.gov/Grants-and-Grantees/CNCS-State-Profiles-2016-2017-Programs-Projects-an/v35n-m8im", "owner": {"id": "x3da-yqfi", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Breems, Joseph"}, "creator": {"id": "x3da-yqfi", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Breems, Joseph"}}
